    'Za tebe ako želiš graditi vlastiti tim. Uz preporuke i kupce rano učiš pozivati, predstavljati posao i pomagati novim suradnicima.' => 'For you if you want to build your own team. Alongside recommendations and customers, you learn early on how to invite, present the business and help new members.',
